          "upstreamBehaviour": "Doc, Glyphs, Token and Status freeze nodes, arrays or shared defaults; logging, UI selection, issue trees and helpers use native Set/Map/Object methods; testing uses Date.now, prototype Console wrappers and cast Node streams; inkChalk returns a Promise using node:fs.realpathSync.",
          "labBehaviour": "Readonly unfrozen copies/shared defaults replace frozen values; HashSet/MutableHashSet/HashMap/MutableHashMap, Record and Clock helpers replace native operations; HelpRouting/CliUiTest explicitly delegate Console methods; fakeStreams implements TTY members; inkChalk and its cached bridge use FileSystem Effects; MultiSelect.chosen is HashSet with document-order selection.",
          "reason": "native-runtime: Native-runtime law and later 2026-10-09 grilling remove allowlisted native collections, Object.freeze, prototype wrappers and direct filesystem access; freeze tests now pin content, copies and identity. Main sites: Doc, Glyphs, Token, Status, CliLog/CliRuntime, internal/format/HelpRouting, MultiSelect, CliUiTest/fakeStreams and inkChalk."
        },
        {
