          "reason": "identity-keys: Later 2026-10-09 identity-structure ruling requires ancestor stacks and owned primitive ids instead of global reference marking; step-4 identity routing also changes Context keys (round-1 codemod-6). Each structure preserves its identity semantics."
        },
        {
